{"unit_id":"WongYuYe__dsh-composer-recall#card-zh","repo":"WongYuYe/dsh-composer-recall","commit":"3a816a36648007a9eb266798234118600a3e88c9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-composer-recall 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的输入历史插件。它把浏览器端逻辑接入当前会话的 Lexical 输入框，在草稿为空或光标位于开头时按上方向键，即可逐条调出本会话已显示的用户消息；下方向键向较新的消息前进，Escape 恢复进入历史前暂存的草稿。浏览历史时直接输入会保留当前文本并退出历史模式。插件适合经常重复输入提示词、需要找回刚才内容的 DSH 用户；依赖 DSH 0.1.2-alpha.1 及以上版本所用的输入组件，不需要 API 密钥或额外账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:109-180","package.json:46-59"]}
{"unit_id":"WongYuYe__dsh-composer-recall#card-en","repo":"WongYuYe/dsh-composer-recall","commit":"3a816a36648007a9eb266798234118600a3e88c9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-composer-recall adds history to the DSH web composer. Press Arrow Up at the start of an empty draft to recall current-session prompts; Arrow Down moves forward and Escape restores the saved draft. Typing exits history while keeping the text. It needs the DSH Lexical composer and no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:109-180","package.json:46-59"]}
